{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":57,"count":34,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-1-15\",\"星期天\",\"星期天\",\"星期天\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我每個星期天早上都跟家人去教堂。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-2-18","sourceFront":"教堂","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"星期天 means Sunday. In the star-cycle (星期), the unnumbered 'day' (天) is Sunday."},{"key":"[\"B1L02-2-03\",\"週末\",\"週末\",\"周末\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"今天是星期五，明天是週末，你們要不要來我家？","pinyin":"Jīntiān shì xīngqí wǔ, míngtiān shì zhōumò, nǐmen yào bú yào lái wǒ jiā?","english":"Today is Friday and it is the weekend tomorrow. Do you want to come to my place?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-01","sourceFront":"明天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你週末有空嗎？","pinyin":"Nǐ zhōumò yǒukòng ma?","english":"Are you available this weekend?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-15","sourceFront":"有空","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我每個週末去學校打籃球。","pinyin":"Wǒ měi ge zhōumò qù xuéxiào dǎ lánqiú.","english":"I go to school to play basketball every weekend.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-04","sourceFront":"籃球","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個週末我們一起去看海，怎麼樣？","pinyin":"Zhè ge zhōumò wǒmen yìqǐ qù kàn hǎi, zěnmeyàng?","english":"How about going to watch the sea this weekend?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-09","sourceFront":"海","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個週末我們要去騎腳踏車／自行車。","pinyin":"Zhè ge zhōumò wǒmen yào qù qí jiǎotàchē/zìxíngchē.","english":"This weekend we are going to ride bikes.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-16","sourceFront":"腳踏車/自行車","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"友美，妳這個週末要做什麼？","pinyin":"Yǒuměi, nǐ zhè ge zhōumò yào zuò shénme?","english":"Youmei, what are you going to do this weekend?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-01","sourceFront":"錢包","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這兩天天氣有點兒冷，我們週末去，好嗎？","pinyin":"Zhè liǎng tiān tiānqì yǒudiǎnr lěng, wǒmen zhōumò qù, hǎo ma?","english":"It is a bit cold those two days. How about we do it this weekend?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我平常坐紅線去學校上課，週末也坐捷運去運動、看電影。","pinyin":"Wǒ píngcháng zuò hóng xiàn qù xuéxiào shàngkè, zhōumò yě zuò jiéyùn qù yùndòng, kàn diànyǐng.","english":"I usually go to school by the red one. On weekends I take it to exercise or see a movie as well.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"沒關係，我們可以下個週末再來看。對了，妳要買鞋子吧？","pinyin":"Méiguānxi, wǒmen kěyǐ xià ge zhōumò zài lái kàn. Duìle, nǐ yào mǎi xiézi ba?","english":"It’s okay; we can come again next weekend. By the way, you want to buy shoes, don’t you?","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那我這個週末一定要去看看。","pinyin":"Nà wǒ zhè ge zhōumò yídìng yào qù kànkan.","english":"Well then, I must see it this weekend.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我週末還要工作，打算一下班就去看燈會。我們可以約友美一起去。","pinyin":"Wǒ zhōumò hái yào gōngzuò, dǎsuàn yí xiàbān jiù qù kàn dēnghuì. Wǒmen kěyǐ yuē Yǒuměi yìqǐ qù.","english":"I have to work on weekends, and plan to go to the Lantern Carnival as soon as I get off from work. We can ask Youmei out for the Lantern Carnival together.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"週(week) + 末(end) → the week's end is the weekend."},{"key":"[\"B1L11-1-15\",\"还\",\"還\",\"还\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你喜歡山上的風景還是海邊的風景？","pinyin":"Nǐ xǐhuān shānshàng de fēngjǐng háishì hǎibiān de fēngjǐng?","english":"Do you like the scenery on the mountain or on the beach?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-11","sourceFront":"風景","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你要果汁還是牛奶？","pinyin":"Nǐ yào guǒzhī háishì niúnǎi?","english":"Do you want juice or milk?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-3-07","sourceFront":"牛奶","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你要喝什麼？咖啡還是茶？","pinyin":"Nǐ yào hē shénme? Kāfēi háishì chá?","english":"What do you want to drink? Coffee or tea?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-02","sourceFront":"還是","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我們要怎麼去？坐捷運還是坐公車？","pinyin":"Wǒmen yào zěnme qù? Zuò jiéyùn háishì zuò gōngchē?","english":"How do we get there? By MRT or bus?","sourceCardId":"B1L07-1-01","sourceFront":"怎麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"請問兩位要紅茶還是綠茶？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn liǎng wèi yào hóngchá háishì lǜchá?","english":"Would you like to have black tea or green tea?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"好啊！你想喝什麼？咖啡還是茶？","pinyin":"Hǎo a! Nǐ xiǎng hē shénme? Kāfēi háishì chá?","english":"Okay! What would you like to drink? Coffee or tea?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"友美說她想去，我還沒決定去不去。燈會好玩嗎？","pinyin":"Yǒuměi shuō tā xiǎng qù, wǒ háiméi juédìng qù bú qù. Dēnghuì hǎowán ma?","english":"Youmei wants to see it. But I haven’t decided to go. Is the Lantern Carnival fun?","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我週末還要工作，打算一下班就去看燈會。我們可以約友美一起去。","pinyin":"Wǒ zhōumò hái yào gōngzuò, dǎsuàn yí xiàbān jiù qù kàn dēnghuì. Wǒmen kěyǐ yuē Yǒuměi yìqǐ qù.","english":"I have to work on weekends, and plan to go to the Lantern Carnival as soon as I get off from work. We can ask Youmei out for the Lantern Carnival together.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L13-1-02\",\"電子郵件\",\"電子郵件\",\"电子邮件\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"電子(electronic) + 郵(mail) + 件(item) → electronic mail: 電子郵件 is email."},{"key":"[\"B1L13-1-04\",\"剛剛\",\"剛剛\",\"刚刚\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我剛剛在學校附近看到中明。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L13-1-04","sourceFront":"剛剛","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"山本良介還在台灣學中文，他的中文課明年二月才結束。我今天有三個小時的數學課，剛剛才下課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-26","sourceFront":"才","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你剛剛說要吃漢堡，現在說要吃炸雞，到底要吃什麼？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-44","sourceFront":"到底","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們剛剛在燒竹子的時候，火非常大。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-18","sourceFront":"火","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"剛剛大家推來推去的，結果把瓶子給打破了，這算誰的錯？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-52","sourceFront":"算","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我剛剛忘了把垃圾拿出去丟，還好你提醒我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-11","sourceFront":"提醒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你那一付筷子剛剛掉到地上弄髒了，我再幫你換一付新的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-40","sourceFront":"付","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"剛(just), twice in a row: 剛剛(just now)."},{"key":"[\"B1L16-2-10\",\"一半\",\"一半/一半兒\",\"一半/一半儿\",\"Det\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"為什麼她咖啡喝了一半就不喝了？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-2-10","sourceFront":"一半","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我很餓，同事把他的薯條分一半給我，讓我好感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-13","sourceFront":"分","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們爬山爬到一半就起風了，過了幾分鐘就下起大雨來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-23","sourceFront":"起","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天棒球賽進行到一半時突然下起了大雨，雖然後來雨停了，但因為球場太溼，也無法繼續比賽了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-16","sourceFront":"進行","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"好的開始是成功的一半，第一步往往最重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-37","sourceFront":"步","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據美國某項研究資料，青少年因腦震盪而被送到醫院的意外中，超過一半是因為激烈運動引起的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-03","sourceFront":"腦震盪","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在自由戀愛的時代中，還是有人透過相親的方式來認識另一半。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-11","sourceFront":"相親","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"一(one) + 半(half) → a half of one: 一半 means one half."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-16\",\"當然\",\"當然\",\"当然\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"今天是我第一天上班，當然不能遲到。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-16","sourceFront":"當然","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我是在台灣長大的，當然去過夜市。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-04","sourceFront":"長大","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你說老闆下個月要提高每個人的薪水，沒騙我吧？ B:這個消息是從他的口中說出來的，當然是真的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-34","sourceFront":"口","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L02-2-15\",\"全部\",\"全部\",\"全部\",\"Det\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他把全部的碗筷都擦乾了，可以給客人用了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-2-15","sourceFront":"全部","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"今天我請客，大家要吃什麼、喝什麼，全部我付錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-28","sourceFront":"請客","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"山本良介很厲害，早上剛學的五十個生字全部都記得了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-14","sourceFront":"厲害","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小馬先用手機把要賣的商品全部都拍了下來，再放到網路上賣，一個星期就賣完了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-20","sourceFront":"拍","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L05-2-19\",\"月亮\",\"月亮\",\"月亮\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"昨天晚上的月亮又大又圓，你看到了嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-19","sourceFront":"月亮","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"月亮上面沒有動物，這是1969年科學的新發現。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-2-21","sourceFront":"發現","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"中秋節是華人團圓的日子，除了吃月餅、欣賞月亮，還會一起烤肉","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-31","sourceFront":"團圓","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"傳說月亮上住著一隻兔子，這個神話留給孩子們許多想像空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-04","sourceFront":"傳說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L09-2-10\",\"报告\",\"報告\",\"报告\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"上中文課時，老師要我們用中文報告在台灣的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-10","sourceFront":"報告","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這個週末我得在家做一份報告，不能出去玩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-23","sourceFront":"報告","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我是陳老闆的助理，每天得向他報告公司的情況。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-20","sourceFront":"向","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了做這個報告，經理已經跟我們開過三次會了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-26","sourceFront":"開會","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師的要求很多，要寫五篇報告、三篇作文，怎麼寫得完？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-02","sourceFront":"要求","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"等我完成期末報告，就要跟同學去韓國旅遊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-04","sourceFront":"完成","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位教授看報告看得很仔細，你可不能亂寫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-09","sourceFront":"仔細","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你怎麼了？昨天晚上沒睡好嗎？ B:嗯。要不是開夜車趕報告， 現在也不會這麼沒精神。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-36","sourceFront":"嗯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"新聞報告說颱風快來了，出門時得注意安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-02","sourceFront":"颱風","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個週末我過得很充實，不但完成了期末報告，還跟同學去游泳、衝浪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-07","sourceFront":"充實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一份研究報告表示，對陌生環境適應能力越強的人，未來成功的機會也越高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-18","sourceFront":"陌生","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有關這場火災的詳細情況，等調查結果出來以後，市長會向民眾報告。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-31","sourceFront":"有關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:糟了，我不小心把隨身碟弄丟了，資料都存在裡面。 B:這下子我們的期末報告都白做了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-20","sourceFront":"這下子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的歷史作業寫完了，同時也把明天要報告的古蹟資料準備好了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-03","sourceFront":"同時","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你寄報告給老師前最好確認一下地址，萬一老師沒收到，到時你就麻煩了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-19","sourceFront":"到時","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上臺報告以前要把資料準備好，以免到時候手忙腳亂的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-37","sourceFront":"上臺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chin