"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-39","sourceFront":"彈","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從小時候起，他的第一志願就是當一位保護國家的軍人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-03","sourceFront":"志願","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"除非別人願意，否則你不該強迫其他人全按你的意見做事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-45","sourceFront":"強迫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"天天說自己外行、不願嘗試的人，就無法更深入地瞭解世界。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-08","sourceFront":"外行","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他對志工服務一向有興趣，哪怕做得又忙又累，他也願意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-34","sourceFront":"哪怕","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當你願意開放自己的心時， 你所見的世界也會更加地美妙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-18","sourceFront":"美妙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那棟沒有主人的房屋充滿恐怖的傳說，一般人都不願意靠近。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-31","sourceFront":"恐怖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他對發展新科技向來保守，不願接受人工智慧產品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-19","sourceFront":"向來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L06-1-22\",\"門票\",\"門票\",\"门票\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我買了海洋公園的門票，打算利用週末帶孩子一起去逛逛。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-22","sourceFront":"門票","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那場演唱會請到了大家最喜愛的明星，所以門票很快就被搶光了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-41","sourceFront":"搶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"聽說那場演唱會很熱門，我們最好先預訂門票。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-47","sourceFront":"預訂","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-2-05\",\"毛巾\",\"毛巾\