ourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你把廣告設計得那麼小，這樣的宣傳怎麼有效果呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-22","sourceFront":"宣傳","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我看見路口有人舉著一面牌子，上面是銷售房屋的廣告。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-45","sourceFront":"面","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這次會議的主題跟銷售新產品有關，所以廣告部門的人員得參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-02","sourceFront":"主題","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家廣告公司提供了五個工作機會，只要是設計系畢業的都可以去試試看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-07","sourceFront":"提供","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:謝謝你的幫助。沒有你的話， 我一個人很難完成新產品的廣告設計。 B:別這麼說。我們是同事，互相幫助是應該的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-44","sourceFront":"別這麼說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他是廣告公司的經理，每天要做好多事，忙得不得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-13","sourceFront":"做事","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那支新手機的廣告做得很好，很多人都被吸引了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-07","sourceFront":"廣告","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"別\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 口(mouth) calls out as a 刂(knife) slices the loaf → time to 別(separate)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"哪裡\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"哪(which) + 裡(inside) → 'which place?' 哪裡 means where."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"多少\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"多(much) + 少(little) → asking 'much or little?' means 'how many/how much'."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"帥\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Stationed upon a defensive 阜(mound), the commander straightens his silk 巾(cloth) looking dashing and 帥(handsome)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"春\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"三(sprouts) rest with a 人(person) in the 日(sun) → 春(springtime)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"祖母\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 祖(ancestor) and 母(mother): 祖母 means grandmother."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"自信\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 自(self) and 信(trust): 自信 means self-confidence."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"見面\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"見(see) + 面(face) → seeing each other's face: 見面(to meet up)."}]}
